# #152 drills and multi-hit aerials: Rifleman's shared up air (2 hits). Rifleman a against Rifleman b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero rifleman
# Both dash in, close.
40 b stick -1 0
42 b stick 0 0
50 a stick 1 0
52 a stick 0 0
# Up air under b, which jumped first toward a.
94 b tap B 8
95 b stick -0.6 0
100 a tap B 8
101 a stick 0.6 0
120 a cstick 0 1
120 a stick 0 0
120 b stick 0 0
124 a cstick 0 0
# Frames saved on hits (native only; illustration for the look box).
125 a capture
130 a capture
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script): the aerial starts, then every hit.
#! expect a 120 applied attack 1 style 15
#! expect b 126 damage 4.000
#! expect b 130 damage 12.000
#! scene a ImpactHit-
# View held a second, twice: the moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
